aegis-shell (1.6.4-m2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * user-places.xbel: the ROOT metadata must live inside an <info> element
    — KBookmark::metaData() does cd(xbelElement, "info", false) before
    findMetadata(), so a bare <metadata> directly under <xbel> is never
    found and every root-metadata read returned empty (kde_places_version
    -> 0 -> v0→4 migration on every first launch: defaults re-created
    beside the seed; GroupState-* / withRecentlyUsed / withBaloo ignored).
    v0.6.3 already fixed the item format (tag-name keys); v0.6.4 wraps the
    root metadata block in <info>. Per-bookmark metadata was already
    correct (inside its own <info>).

